# Edits not yet saved: positions move with the text. A request in an
# edited file reads the analysis at the place the analysis saw, its
# answers land where that text is now, and the analysis's diagnostics
# move with their text; text written since has no answers, and a
# diagnostic whose text an edit replaced is dropped. A rename waits for a
# save.
initialize root main.tally
open util.tally
open main.tally
edit util.tally 1:1-1:1 "# Moved down a line.\n"
hover util.tally 3:4
definition main.tally 4:18
references util.tally 3:4
edit main.tally 1:1-1:1 "\n"
edit main.tally 16:1-16:8 "zero"
hover main.tally 5:5
rename util.tally 3:4 plus
edit util.tally 3:4-3:7 "plus"
hover util.tally 3:4
definition main.tally 5:18
save util.tally
save main.tally
hover util.tally 3:4
